#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapistructimage.rst:2
msgid "Lua API: image"
msgstr "API Lua : image"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapistructimage.rst:4
msgid ""
"This wiki page documented the CamScripter Lua API ``image`` data structure, "
"but its content was not preserved in the archive."
msgstr ""
"Cette page wiki documentait la structure de données ``image`` de l'API Lua "
"CamScripter, mais son contenu n'a pas été conservé dans l'archive."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam3/luaapistructimage.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``image`` data structure is created with :doc:`image_new "
"<luaapifunctions>`, and is used with functions such as "
":doc:`pixbuf_read_rows <luaapifunctions>` and :doc:`framediff_scanline "
"<luaapifunctions>`."
msgstr ""
"La structure de données ``image`` est créée avec :doc:`image_new "
"<luaapifunctions>`, et est utilisée avec des fonctions telles que "
":doc:`pixbuf_read_rows <luaapifunctions>` et :doc:`framediff_scanline "
"<luaapifunctions>`."
